<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-130" chapter-id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui" source-id="s-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui-ws2097331">
  <p id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">立其妻梁氏為王后，子<persName id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui:p001:m0010" ref="fd5_0ae_506_A">璝</persName>為太子，封子延陽平公，<persName id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui:p001:m0022" ref="be2_1b4_a75">昌</persName>太原公，倫酒泉公，定平原公，滿河南公，安中山公。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui:p002:m0000" ref="fd5_0ae_506">勃勃</persName>善之，以子<persName id="c-jinshu-130-fu-helian-gui:p002:m0007" ref="fd5_0ae_506_A">璝</persName>都督前鋒諸軍事，領撫軍大將軍，率騎二萬南伐長安，</p>
</text>
